# Pharmacovigilance Task: ADR Reporting & Documentation

## Overview
This repository contains the completed Adverse Drug Reaction (ADR) reporting form for **Task 2**. This exercise simulates real-world pharmacovigilance reporting systems used in the healthcare and pharmaceutical industries to monitor drug safety and patient outcomes.

**Task Reference:** `Screenshot_2026-09-26-15-40-39-61_40deb401b9ffe8e1df2f1cc5ba480b12.jpg`
**Data Source:** Case scenario extracted from [How to fill ADR form? Step by Step Guide](https://youtu.be/ShJ-SXC1qNc).

